    {
      "_id": "wa9pMOIylELwm28y",
      "name": "Death Strike {@recharge 5}",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The revenant makes one scythe attack. If the attack hits, it deals an extra 42 ([[/damage 12d6 necrotic]]). The target must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the necrotic damage taken. This reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0.\n\nA humanoid slain by this attack rises 24 hours later as a zombie under the revenant's control, unless the humanoid is restored to life or its body is destroyed. The revenant can have no more than twenty zombies under its control at one time.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
